    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52479" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλᾰμ-άομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gather
